    "title": "Live Funny Face Camera",
    "description": "Use smart funny stickers that apply on faces on live camera. The live stickers collection is all new and exciting. \r\nAlong with funny camera use Photo filters, photo frames, beauty filters for your sweet and beautiful selfies.\r\nApply the best beauty mirror effects and filters.\r\n\r\nUse Live Face Funny Camera as a face changer app, that allows you to use live face stickers, head stickers, mustache face stickers, doggy face stickers, animojis, etcs.\r\nEdit your photos with many photo editing tools.\r\n\r\nApp Features :\r\n\r\n- Add Funny Stickers on live camera - All new & exciting live stickers available.\r\n- Use live frames on camera.\r\n- Try out live camera filters.\r\n- Use camera with funny mirror effects.\r\n- Add face stickers like - man hairstyle, women hairstyle, mustache, doggy face stickers, turban or caps, other accessories.\r\n- Use photo editing tools to make it even attractive photo.\r\n- Add Saturation, Brightness, Contrast in filter images.\r\n- Save and share your live funny face camera photo on social media.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLive face funny camera captures vibrant images using most applicable filters which share with your friends and relatives and enjoy beautiful images.",
